# liteDS-v2 input script - Rockwrestler (RockPolish, 2023 WIP DS tester).
# Hierarchical menu: A drills ARMv4 -> sub-test list -> runs the test
# (result shown as 'OK' top-left, or an error code on failure). Pulsing A
# drives into ARMv4 and cycles its condition-code / instruction sub-tests,
# all reporting OK. 600-frame run; interp and JIT are byte-identical.
# Format: '<frame> <keys>' = hold exactly those keys from that frame on.

